# dsh-plugin-boot-whale-maid — npm pack exclusions
#
# The review screenshots under docs/shots/ document the build FOR THE
# REPOSITORY (they are cited by docs/VISUAL-REVIEW.md). They are not plugin
# assets, so they stay out of the installable tarball. The corresponding
# Markdown documents still ship, because their text is part of the package's
# attribution and verification record.
#
# Nothing from the maid-atelier skin package is ever bundled: that artwork is
# referenced at runtime only, over the same-origin route
# /skin-assets/maid-atelier/<hash>.webp. See LICENSE and docs/ATTRIBUTION.md.

docs/shots/

# Local build/verification scratch, never part of a release.
.npm-cache/
.packcheck/
dist/
.git/
.gitignore
npm-debug.log*
